   "_comment_dressing": "Enemy spawns are Chebyshev 5 from the player spawn ON PURPOSE: 3 free steps exhaust the pool short of contact (beat 3), Dash covers the rest with AP to spare for one attack -- the full teaching arc fits in turn 1.",
   "floor_layers": [
    {
     "_pick": "trampled practice-ground patch, whole-image tile",
