     "requires_any_class": true,
     "requires_ally": "relc",
     "line": "Relc: Real ones this time. Stay behind me if you have to. You slept, so check your numbers: 3 and up are your [Skills] now. Earned, not given.",
     "fallback_line": "Relc: Real ones this time. Stay behind me if you have to. No numbers yet -- you haven't slept. Win this, then get back to the inn and sleep. That's when the real stuff shows up.",
